From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: place Frame accessibility in initializer

Repair 0118 when its context matched the class body instead of
FrameContainer.__init__. Remove the misplaced statements and add them after
the initializer's super call.

--- a/src/jarabe/frame/framewindow.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/frame/framewindow.py
@@ -49,2 +49,0 @@
-        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL], [_('Frame')])
-        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
@@ -53,2 +51,4 @@
     def __init__(self, position):
         super().__init__()
+        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL], [_('Frame')])
+        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
         self._position = position
